          "argument_optional": false,
          "detail": "A JMESPath expression compiled by the CLI's query handler against returned JSON. Array indices start at zero and negative indices refer to the end; numeric literals/comparisons/function arguments retain JMESPath/JSON meaning rather than a physical unit. The installed JMESPath library owns parsing and function availability. Reference scope: Azure CLI 2.71.0.",
